gh dojo moves issues through a GitHub Projects board with process verbs
defined in .github/dojo.toml, so agents never deal with field or option IDs.

No process verbs: no .github/dojo.toml found (create one: see https://github.com/Trum-ok/gh-dojo#configuration).

Usage:
  gh dojo [flags]
  gh dojo [command]

Available Commands:
  help        Help about any command
  list        See what is on the board: one line per open issue, grouped by status
  show        Read issues before working on them: board status, blockers, history, description, comments

Flags:
  -h, --help      help for gh dojo
  -v, --version   version for gh dojo

Use "gh dojo [command] --help" for more information about a command.
